DESCRIPTION:Ryan Long  is a comedian\, podcaster\, and filmmaker originall
 y from Toronto who has amassed billions of views across his viral sketches\
 , street interviews\, and stand-up specials. He is the host of the popular 
 podcast The Boyscast with Ryan Long\, and has been featured on Netflix\, 
 NBC\, Just for Laughs\, The Joe Rogan Experience\, Bertcast\, Flagrant\, M
 att and Shane’s Secret Podcast\, and many more.\n\nBeyond his social medi
 a presence\, Ryan was the creator\, star\, and showrunner of the acclaimed 
 CBC Comedy series Torontopia and THAT GUY\, as well as the TV series Ryan
  Long is Challenged (Bite TV) and Crown the Town with Ryan Long (Rogers TV)
 .\n\nBased in New York City\, Ryan is a regular at The Comedy Cellar\, New 
 York Comedy Club\, and The Stand\, and tours internationally performing h
 is unique brand of sharp\, satirical stand-up.\nMore info: https://comedyat
 las.app/comedy-atlas/event/ryan-long-31898/
